1:1 ratio
The general substitution measurement is a 1:1 ratio, meaning recipes which call for one cup of sugar need one cup of xylitol. Xylitol absorbs more moisture than sugar. Your goodies may bake a bit faster when they contain xylitol. When substituting for brown sugar, add 1 – 2 teaspoons of molasses per cup of xylitol.

